OL,3,GNEWSATwo farm workers die after falling
OL,4,Ainto silage tank
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have died after falling into an
OL,7,Findustrial silage tank at a farm in
OL,8,FCheshire.
OL,10,FThe men, aged 42 and 72, were both
OL,11,Fworking on the farm in Aston by
OL,12,FBudworth, near Northwich, when they
OL,13,Ffell into the tank at about 12:20 BST
OL,14,Fon Wednesday, Cheshire Police said.
OL,16,FPolice, firefighters and paramedics
OL,17,Fattended the farm on Cann Lane and
OL,18,Frescued the men from the tank.
OL,20,FHowever, both men were pronounced dead
OL,21,Fat the scene.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
